id     eq  live_norm / ref_norm
L1-TRAILPROSE  DIFF
   LIVE: <ul> <li>A[[LI]]B[[/LI]]<br> [[/UL]]<br> ZZZ</li> </ul>
   REF : <ul> <li>A[[LI]]B[[/LI]]<br> [[/UL]]</li> </ul><br> ZZZ
L2-DBLCLOSER   EQ  
L3-NOLF        EQ  
L4-MULTILI     EQ  
L5-SCOREDTRAIL DIFF
   LIVE: <ul> <li>A[[LI]]B[[/LI]]<br> [[/UL]]<br> ZZZ</li> </ul>
   REF : <ul> <li>A[[LI]]B[[/LI]]<br> [[/UL]]</li> </ul><br> ZZZ
C1-DIVSCORED   DIFF
   LIVE: alpha <div>bravo</div>
   REF : <p>alpha <div>bravo</div></p>
C2-DIVUPPER    DIFF
   LIVE: alpha <div> <p>bravo</p> </div>
   REF : alpha <div><p>bravo</p> </div>
C3-DIVATTR     DIFF
   LIVE: lead text <div class="c" id="u-x"> <p>body</p> </div>
   REF : lead text <div class="c" id="u-x"><p>body</p> </div>
C4-DIVRESID    EQ  
C5-CHAIN       DIFF
   LIVE: alphabeta <div> <p>body</p> </div>
   REF : alphabeta <div><p>body</p> </div>
C6-TOKENLEAD   DIFF
   LIVE: [[size 12px]]lead <div> <p>body</p> </div>
   REF : [[size 12px]]lead <div><p>body</p> </div>
F1-BQMIXED     DIFF
   LIVE: <blockquote> <blockquote> <p>x</p> </blockquote> </blockquote>
   REF : <blockquote><blockquote><p>x</p> </blockquote> </blockquote>
F2-COLLEMPTY   DIFF
   LIVE: <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+ show block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">– hide block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div>
   REF : <div class="collapsible-block"><div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+ show block</a></div><div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"><div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">– hide block</a></div><div class="collapsible-block-content"></div></div></div>
F3-DIVC0       EQ  
F4-DIVTABATTR  EQ  
F5-BRKQUOTE    DIFF
   LIVE: <blockquote> <p>a<br> b</p> </blockquote>
   REF : <blockquote><p>a<br> b</p> </blockquote>
equal: 6 / 16
